    "updated_at": "2021-02-08T18:14:55Z",
    "body": "This looks like fish and iTerm don't agree on the width of the current line, causing the `RPROMPT` to bleed into the next line. Does `set fish_emoji_width 2` help? You might be able to work around this issue with the [nerd font preset](https://starship.rs/presets/) to avoid emoji characters.",
