    "updated_at": "2021-02-08T18:30:53Z",
    "body": "Adding to David's suggestions, I'd recommend changing the iTerm character width configuration in Preferences > Profiles > Text. \"Use Unicode version 9+ widths\" and \"Ambiguous characters are double-width\" may change the way character widths are handled by iTerm.",
